<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Boiler Water Limits</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  The material contained within the first set of brackets will be used 
for steam boilers.  The material contained within the second set of brackets 
will be used for hot water boilers.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Consult the boiler manufacturer for the determination of the boiler water chemical composition limits.  The boiler 
water limits are as follows unless dictated differently by the boiler manufacturer's recommendations:</TXT><BRK/>
